/span><span begin="01:27.074" end="01:30.195">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.474" end="01:44.323"><span begin="01:30.474" end="01:32.170">Some </span><span begin="01:32.170" end="01:34.234">day </span><span begin="01:34.234" end="01:35.234">someone </span><span begin="01:35.234" end="01:35.962">will </span><span begin="01:35.962" end="01:36.354">like </span><span begin="01:36.354" end="01:36.864">me </span><span begin="01:36.864" end="01:39.343">like </span><span begin="01:39.343" end="01:39.647">I </span><span begin="01:39.647" end="01:40.623">like </span><span begin="01:40.623" end="01:44.323">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.235" end="01:49.694"><span begin="01:45.235" end="01:45.579">Until </span><span begin="01:45.579" end="01:45.891">then </span><span begin="01:45.891" end="01:46.131">I'll </span><span begin="01:46.131" end="01:46.918">drink </span><span begin="01:47.071" end="01:47.390">my </span><span begin="01:47.390" end="01:48.430">coffee </span><span begin="01:48.430" end="01:49.054">eat </span><span begin="01:49.054" end="01:49.326">my </span><span begin="01:49.326" end="01:49.694">pie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.694" end="01:57.382"><span begin="01:49.694" end="01:50.550">Pretend </span><span begin="01:50.550" end="01:50.838">that </span><span begin="01:50.838" end="01:51.142">we </span><span begin="01:51.142" end="01:51.688">are </span><span begin="01:51.688" end="01:53.407">more </span><span begin="01:53.726" end="01:54.638">than </span><span begin="01:54.638" end="01:57.382">friends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.542" end="02:01.673"><span begin="01:59.542" end="01:59.854">Then </span><span begin="01:59.854" end="02:00.142">of </span><span begin="02:00.142" end="02:00.382">course </span><span begin="02:00.382" end="02:00.630">I'll </span><span begin="02:00.630" end="02:01.673">let</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.825" end="02:07.986"><span begin="02:01.825" end="02:02.081">You </span><span begin="02:02.081" end="02:02.345">break </span><span begin="02:02.345" end="02:02.681">my </span><span begin="02:02.681" end="02:03.410">heart </span><span begin="02:03.953" end="02:07.986">again</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.921" end="02:24.457"><span begin="02:14.921" end="02:15.337">I'm </span><span begin="02:15.337" end="02:15.745">just </span><span begin="02:15.745" end="02:16.673">tryna </span><span begin="02:16.673" end="02:20.066">understand </span><span begin="02:21.394" end="02:22.193">what </span><span begin="02:22.193" end="02:22.569">I </span><span begin="02:22.569" end="02:22.953">am </span><span begin="02:22.953" end="02:23.353">to </span><span begin="02:23.353" end="02:24.457">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:24.457" end="02:28.260"><span begin="02:24.457" end="02:24.785">More </span><span begin="02:24.785" end="02:25.105">than </span><span begin="02:25.105" end="02:25.745">songs </span><span begin="02:25.745" end="02:26.289">we've </span><span begin="02:26.289" end="02:28.260">exchanged</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.260" end="02:34.829"><span begin="02:28.260" end="02:28.557">Midnight </span><span begin="02:28.732" end="02:30.221">calls </span><span begin="02:31.565" end="02:34.829">sunset</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:41.869" end="02:47.333"><span begin="02:41.869" end="02:42.621">Promise </span><span begin="02:42.621" end="02:44.044">I </span><span begin="02:44.044" end="02:44.333">don't </span><span begin="02:44.333" end="02:45.397">mean </span><span begin="02:45.669" end="02:46.029">to </span><span begin="02:46.029" end="02:47.333">cry</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:48.677" end="02:54.157"><span begin="02:48.677" end="02:48.885">But </span><span begin="02:48.885" end="02:49.245">I </span><span begin="02:49.470" end="02:49.821">get </span><span begin="02:50.253" end="02:51.477">overwhelmed </span><span begin="02:51.925" end="02:52.181">and </span><span begin="02:52.181" end="02:54.157">confused</span></p